      "level": 4,
      "name": "Healing Touch",
      "slug": "healing-touch",
      "traits": [
        "archetype"
      ],
      "type": "feat"
    },
    {
      "actionCost": "1",
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Requirements",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": true,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "content": " You are holding or wearing healer's tools.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "kind": "divider"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "You can patch up yourself or an adjacent ally, even in combat. Attempt a Medicine check with the same DC as for ",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "display": "Treat Wounds",
              "kind": "crossref",
              "targetId": "action/treat-wounds"
            },
            {
              "content": ", and restore a corresponding amount of Hit Points; this does not remove the ",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "display": "Wounded",
              "kind": "crossref",
              "targetId": "condition/wounded"
            },
            {
              "content": " condition. As with Treat Wounds, you can attempt checks against higher DCs if you have the minimum proficiency rank. The target is then temporarily ",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "display": "immune",
              "kind": "brokenRef",
              "target": "Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Battle Medicine Immunity"
            },
            {
              "content": " to your Battle Medicine for 1 day.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Editors note",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": true,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "content": " Paizo has clarified the usage of worn tools:",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "content": "Worn tools should only take 1 hand to use, as you only draw the things you need from the kit and not the entire kit. This has been marked for future errata.",
                  "kind": "text",
                  "marks": {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "superscript": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "kind": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "kind": "blockquote"
