    {
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Your hands become infused with vitality energy, healing a living creature or damaging an undead creature with a touch.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "If you use lay on hands on a willing living target, you restore 6 Hit Points; if the target is one of your allies, they also gain a +2 status bonus to AC for 1 round.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Against an undead target, you deal 1d6 damage and it must attempt a basic Fortitude save; if it fails, it also takes a -2 status penalty to AC for 1 round.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "kind": "divider"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Heightened (+1)",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": true,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "content": " The amount of healing increases by 6, and the damage to an undead target increases by 1d6.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "display": "Spell Effect: Lay on Hands",
              "kind": "brokenRef",
              "target": "Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Spell Effect: Lay on Hands"
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
