    {
      "body": [],
      "level": 0,
      "name": "Tankard (from the good old days)",
      "slug": "tankard-from-the-good-old-days",
      "traits": [],
      "type": "treasure"
    },
    {
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Fighting for honor, greed, loyalty, or simply the thrill of battle, you are an undisputed master of weaponry and combat techniques. You combine your actions through clever combinations of opening moves, finishing strikes, and counterattacks whenever your foes are unwise enough to drop their guard. Whether you are a knight, mercenary, sharpshooter, or blade master, you have honed your martial skills into an art form and perform devastating critical attacks on your enemies.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": true,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "display": "Fighter",
              "kind": "crossref",
              "targetId": "class/fighter"
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "name": "Fighter",
      "slug": "fighter",
      "traits": [],
      "type": "class"
    },
    {
      "actionCost": "passive",
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Ever watchful for weaknesses, you can quickly attack foes that leave an opening in their defenses. You gain the ",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "display": "Reactive Strike",
              "kind": "crossref",
              "targetId": "action/reactive-strike"
            },
            {
              "content": " reaction.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "name": "Attack of Opportunity",
      "slug": "attack-of-opportunity",
      "traits": [
        "fighter"
      ],
      "type": "feat"
    },
    {
      "actionCost": "passive",
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "You gain the ",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "display": "Shield Block",
              "kind": "crossref",
              "targetId": "feat/shield-block"
            },
            {
              "content": " general feat, a reaction that lets you reduce damage with your shield.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "name": "Shield Block",
      "slug": "shield-block",
      "traits": [
        "champion",
        "druid",
        "fighter"
      ],
      "type": "feat"
    },
    {
      "actionCost": "passive",
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Having faced countless foes and the chaos of battle, you have learned how to stand strong in the face of fear and keep on fighting. Your proficiency rank for Will saves increases to expert. When you roll a success at a Will save against a fear effect, you get a critical success instead. In addition, anytime you gain the frightened condition, reduce its value by 1.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "level": 3,
      "name": "Bravery",
      "slug": "bravery",
      "traits": [
        "fighter"
      ],
      "type": "feat"
    },
    {
      "actionCost": "passive",
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Hours spent training with your preferred weapons, learning and developing new combat techniques, have made you particularly effective with your weapons of choice. Choose one weapon group. Your proficiency rank increases to master with the simple weapons, martial weapons, and unarmed attacks in that group, and to expert with the advanced weapons in that group. You gain access to the critical specialization effects of all weapons and unarmed attacks for which you have master proficiency.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "level": 5,
      "name": "Fighter Weapon Mastery (Sword)",
      "slug": "fighter-weapon-mastery-sword",
      "traits": [
        "fighter"
      ],
      "type": "feat"
    },
    {
      "actionCost": "reaction",
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Trigger",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": true,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "content": " A creature within your reach uses a manipulate action or a move action, makes a ranged attack, or leaves a square during a move action it's using.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "kind": "divider"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "You lash out at a foe that leaves an opening. Make a melee Strike against the triggering creature. If your attack is a critical hit and the trigger was a manipulate action, you disrupt that action. This Strike doesn't count toward your multiple attack penalty, and your multiple attack penalty doesn't apply to this Strike.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "name": "Attack of Opportunity",
      "slug": "attack-of-opportunity",
      "traits": [],
      "type": "action"
    },
    {
      "actionCost": "reaction",
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "Trigger",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": true,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            },
            {
              "content": " While you have your shield raised, you would take damage from a physical attack",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "kind": "divider"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "You snap your shield in place to ward off a blow. Your shield prevents you from taking an amount of damage up to the shield's Hardness. You and the shield each take any remaining damage, possibly breaking or destroying the shield.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": false,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "name": "Shield Block",
      "slug": "shield-block",
      "traits": [
        "general"
      ],
      "type": "feat"
    },
    {
      "body": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "content": "As unpredictable and varied as any of Golarion's peoples, humans have exceptional drive and the capacity to endure and expand. Though many civilizations thrived before humanity rose to prominence, humans have built some of the greatest and the most terrible societies throughout the course of history, and today they are the most populous people in the realms around the Inner Sea.",
              "kind": "text",
              "marks": {
                "bold": false,
                "italic": true,
                "superscript": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
